{"id":"da661bfc44ef4f5a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-rp-amplification.md","title":"独立重复消除单边错误","display":"thm-rp-amplification — 独立重复消除单边错误","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-rp-amplification","aliases":["73-thm-rp-amplification"],"display":"thm-rp-amplification — 独立重复消除单边错误","depends_on":["[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.5, Theorem 11.16, print pp. 508–509; PDF pp. 530–531","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-rp-amplification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-rp-amplification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rp-amplification — 独立重复消除单边错误"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c185b4536ca59db\" href=\"?note=1c185b4536ca59db\" title=\"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp\">73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.5, Theorem 11.16, print pp. 508–509; PDF pp. 530–531"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RPoly},\\Pr^a\">\\(\\mathsf{RPoly},\\Pr^a\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c185b4536ca59db\" href=\"?note=1c185b4536ca59db\" title=\"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp\">73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\bigl[\n\\Pr_N^a(w)=1-(1-\\Pr_M^a(w))^k\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow1-\\Pr_N^a(w)\\le2^{-k})\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\bigl[\n\\Pr_N^a(w)=1-(1-\\Pr_M^a(w))^k\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow1-\\Pr_N^a(w)\\le2^{-k})\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用新随机位独立运行 k 次，有一次接受即接受。所有都拒绝的概率为各次拒绝概率之积。k 在定理实例中固定，k 次多项式运行仍为多项式；也可让 k 随输入以多项式增长，但此处不需要该更强结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","status":"resolved","id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","status":"resolved","id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$。$\\mathsf{RPoly},\\Pr^a$ 见 [[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RPoly},\\Pr^a","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\bigl[\n\\Pr_N^a(w)=1-(1-\\Pr_M^a(w))^k\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow1-\\Pr_N^a(w)\\le2^{-k})\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-rp-amplification|独立重复消除单边错误]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"60807657c822cc57","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1c185b4536ca59db"]}